1
00:00:01,297 --> 00:00:03,619
下午好 感谢各位大驾光临
Good afternoon. Thanks for coming.

2
00:00:03,619 --> 00:00:05,149
能在大家的笑容映衬下度过生日
It's so nice to spend my birthday

3
00:00:05,158 --> 00:00:08,637
我实在倍感荣幸
surrounded by so many smiling faces.

4
00:00:11,673 --> 00:00:14,036
其实今天我本来郁闷得不想来了
I was almost too depressed to come today.

5
00:00:14,046 --> 00:00:17,354
因为我刚意识到我虚度了我的童年
I realized I let my childhood slip away.

6
00:00:18,782 --> 00:00:20,049
各位快行动起来
Come on, everybody!

7
00:00:20,049 --> 00:00:22,724
曼尼的生日会要迟到了
We're gonna be late for Manny's birthday!

8
00:00:22,734 --> 00:00:25,489
快走 快走 快走 快走 快走
Let's go! Let's go! Let's go! Let's go! Let's go!

9
00:00:26,273 --> 00:00:27,761
我这就能走 妈
I'm ready, mom.

10
00:00:27,761 --> 00:00:29,199
-宝贝 你确定吗 -没错
- You sure, honey? - Yep.

11
00:00:29,209 --> 00:00:30,506
那你看下自己的脚
Then take a quick peek at your feet.

12
00:00:31,793 --> 00:00:34,498
卢克 你不给力啊
Oh! Come on, Luke!

13
00:00:35,171 --> 00:00:36,247
您老是要亲自走快点儿呢
Are you gonna walk faster,

14
00:00:36,247 --> 00:00:38,560
还是让我去车里拿莉莉的婴儿车推您走
or should I get Lily's stroller out of the car and push you?

15
00:00:38,560 --> 00:00:39,525
你急什么啊
Would you relax?

16
00:00:39,525 --> 00:00:41,053
那餐馆离这儿也就5分钟
The restaurant's like five minutes away from here

17
00:00:41,053 --> 00:00:42,020
免费润肤露耶
Ohh, free lotion.

18
00:00:42,029 --> 00:00:44,281
别走走停停的了 咱还没给曼尼买礼物呢
Stop Stopping to smell the roses. Manny's present.

19
00:00:44,281 --> 00:00:46,292
你可真是典型的普里契特家的人
Ohh, you are such a Pritchett.

20
00:00:46,312 --> 00:00:47,550
你这是啥意思
What's that supposed to mean?

21
00:00:47,569 --> 00:00:49,731
快走 快走 快走 快走 快走
Let's go! Let's go! Let's go! Let's go! Let's go!

22
00:00:49,751 --> 00:00:51,490
我在找钥匙
I'm looking for the keys!

23
00:00:51,510 --> 00:00:52,748
你总是有理
Of course you are.

24
00:00:52,767 --> 00:00:54,176
我这人一向准时
I like being on time.

25
00:00:54,195 --> 00:00:56,226
这不难做到 因为我有条不紊
It's easy 'cause I'm organized.

26
00:00:56,256 --> 00:00:57,533
我老婆则不然
Not my wife.

27
00:00:57,543 --> 00:00:59,685
按理说在满是行刑队
You'd think growing up in a place

28
00:00:59,685 --> 00:01:00,802
和老酒鬼的国度中长大
full of death squads and drunken uncles,

29
00:01:00,821 --> 00:01:02,782
她做事本该利索点才对
she'd have learned to move a little bit faster.

30
00:01:02,792 --> 00:01:04,390
对不起 对不起
Sorry, sorry.

31
00:01:05,517 --> 00:01:07,006
我刚刚找耳环去了
I couldn't find my earring.

32
00:01:07,025 --> 00:01:09,931
我们说到哪儿啦
So, what were we talking about, huh?

33
00:01:22,720 --> 00:01:24,691
亲爱的 快点儿 我们要迟到了 走吧
Honey, come on. We're gonna be late. Let's go.

34
00:01:24,691 --> 00:01:27,054
好好好 等我填完家庭夏令营申请表就走
Yeah, yeah, just filling out the application to family camp.

35
00:01:27,074 --> 00:01:28,954
你总不能上次赢了热舞比赛
You don't win the "dirty dancing" competition

36
00:01:28,954 --> 00:01:30,724
而这次却不去捍卫你的冠军宝座吧
and not go back to defend your crown.

37
00:01:30,724 --> 00:01:32,624
你说得对 快走吧 亲爱的
That's right. Come on, honey.

38
00:01:32,654 --> 00:01:35,932
不过想要争冠军
But shoot for the king...

39
00:01:35,942 --> 00:01:38,164
除非把冠军干掉
you better kill him.

40
00:01:38,516 --> 00:01:40,789
每年夏天 我们都去参加一周家庭夏令营
Every summer, we spend a week at family camp.

41
00:01:40,789 --> 00:01:44,167
和普通夏令营没差别 不过要全家出动
It's just like regular camp, but with the family!

42
00:01:44,177 --> 00:01:47,917
这还用解释吗 菲尔
I don't think that needed any clarification, Phil.

43
00:01:47,917 --> 00:01:49,054
某人去年输了彩弹大战
Somebody's still a little touchy

44
00:01:49,054 --> 00:01:51,356
-到现在还耿耿于怀呢 -才没有
- about losing last year's color war. - Not.

45
00:01:51,356 --> 00:01:52,886
她是蓝队
She was on team blue...

46
00:01:52,905 --> 00:01:56,695
...我管他们叫"傻队"[谐音"loser"输家]
...or as I like to refer to them as team blue-zer.

47
00:01:56,977 --> 00:01:58,676
-我是白队 -别说了
- And I was on white. - That's good.

48
00:01:58,686 --> 00:02:00,215
-不是白队... -不要说了
- And if you ain't white... - No.

49
00:02:00,235 --> 00:02:01,482
...只能败北
...you ain't right!

50
00:02:01,512 --> 00:02:05,252
菲尔 你怎么还不长记性呢
Phil! Have you learned nothing?

51
00:02:07,444 --> 00:02:09,495
谢啦 伙计
My good man.

52
00:02:19,359 --> 00:02:22,073
好了 同志们快点 给我在前门集合
Okay, come on, everybody. Front door! Now!

53
00:02:22,094 --> 00:02:25,050
克莱尔 别着急 也就十五分钟路程
Claire, relax. It takes 15 minutes to get there.

54
00:02:25,060 --> 00:02:26,086
要二十分钟
It takes 20 minutes.

55
00:02:26,095 --> 00:02:27,062
那是你的路线
If we take your route.

56
00:02:27,071 --> 00:02:28,399
我的路线最直接了
Well, my way is the most direct.

57
00:02:28,418 --> 00:02:29,656
我看是直接堵车了
Directly into traffic.

58
00:02:29,685 --> 00:02:33,566
你的路线直接就是 最烂的那条
Uh, your way is directly into...the suckiest way.

59
00:02:33,576 --> 00:02:34,824
想来点有趣的吗
Want to make this interesting?

60
00:02:34,843 --> 00:02:36,100
我不认为这件事能有趣
Yeah, I don't think that's possible.

61
00:02:36,100 --> 00:02:38,965
咱们一人一辆车 比谁先开到
We take two cars and see who gets there first.

62
00:02:39,056 --> 00:02:41,690
好啊 比就比 现在就比
Fine. Fine. Let's do that. It's on.

63
00:02:41,690 --> 00:02:43,068
太好了 比赛开始
Yeah! It is on!

64
00:02:43,068 --> 00:02:44,336
姑娘们跟我走
I'll take the girls.

65
00:02:44,355 --> 00:02:45,712
卢克 你爸和我要分开
Luke, your dad and I are splitting up.

66
00:02:45,712 --> 00:02:47,603
-为啥啊 -又因为傻事吵架了呗
- Why? - Another one of their stupid arguments.

67
00:02:47,643 --> 00:02:49,402
那好 我要跟老爸
Okay. I'll go with dad.

68
00:02:49,412 --> 00:02:50,741
不不 伙计 跟我走
No, no. Buddy. Come with me.

69
00:02:51,916 --> 00:02:54,480
咱们这就 没穿鞋
Prepare to be -- my shoes.

70
00:02:55,777 --> 00:02:57,788
菲尔 你不给力啊
Come on, Phil!

71
00:03:00,382 --> 00:03:01,367
我看起来咋样
How do I look?

72
00:03:01,367 --> 00:03:02,624
像艾尔·卡彭[美国史上著名黑帮老大]
Like Al Capone.

73
00:03:02,634 --> 00:03:03,187
谢啦
Thanks!

74
00:03:03,187 --> 00:03:05,671
生日快乐 孩子
Happy birthday, kid.

75
00:03:07,682 --> 00:03:09,227
气枪吗
A BB gun?!

76
00:03:09,227 --> 00:03:12,015
好好玩吧 这是当年我爸给我最好的礼物
Enjoy. That's the best gift my dad ever gave me.

77
00:03:12,528 --> 00:03:13,403
我死活找不到钥匙
My keys are nowhere!

78
00:03:13,403 --> 00:03:14,500
我们只能开你的车了
We're gonna have to go in your car.

79
00:03:14,509 --> 00:03:15,606
我的车还在店里
It's in the shop.

80
00:03:15,615 --> 00:03:17,767
你还记得最后一次把钥匙放哪了吗
Where was the last place you put your keys?

81
00:03:17,787 --> 00:03:19,225
这又成我的错啦
Oh, so now it's my fault?

82
00:03:19,245 --> 00:03:21,236
应该是你最后一次把钥匙放哪儿了
Where was the last place you put my keys?

83
00:03:21,256 --> 00:03:23,639
买车的时候放你手里了
In your hand when I bought you the car.

84
00:03:23,649 --> 00:03:25,278
杰 包装盒上写着
Hey, Jay, on the box,

85
00:03:25,278 --> 00:03:27,078
"适合十六岁及以上儿童"
it says "Ages 16 and up."

86
00:03:27,088 --> 00:03:28,958
这礼物适合我吗
Is this an appropriate gift for me?

87
00:03:28,968 --> 00:03:30,517
你开啥玩笑 你生来就十六岁了
Are you kidding me? You were born 16.

88
00:03:30,526 --> 00:03:32,366
你知道吗 要是你没弄丢备用钥匙
You know, we wouldn't be having this problem

89
00:03:32,376 --> 00:03:33,705
咱们现在也不至于这样
if you hadn't lost the spare set.

90
00:03:33,714 --> 00:03:34,649
我才没弄丢呢
I didn't lose them.

91
00:03:34,649 --> 00:03:36,539
是有人进来偷走的
Somebody came in here and stole them!

92
00:03:36,539 --> 00:03:38,992
光偷钥匙不偷车吗
And left the car.

93
00:03:39,606 --> 00:03:41,757
什么叫我生来就十六岁
What do you mean, I was born 16?

94
00:03:41,768 --> 00:03:43,748
我只是说 你一直不像个小孩儿
I'm just saying, you were never much of a kid.

95
00:03:44,211 --> 00:03:46,202
这是好事呀 因为我从来不喜欢小孩儿
And that's a good thing, 'cause I never liked kids.

96
00:03:46,212 --> 00:03:47,881
你不如去冰箱那儿找找
You know, you ought to try the fridge.

97
00:03:47,891 --> 00:03:49,761
上次你就把手机丢那儿了
'Cause that's where we found your cellphone.

98
00:03:49,771 --> 00:03:51,401
就那么一次 杰
It was only one time, Jay.

99
00:03:51,420 --> 00:03:54,286
你知道我一跟我妈打完电话 就想吃东西
And you know I always eat after I talk to my mother.

100
00:03:55,673 --> 00:03:58,197
生日快乐 老伙计
Happy birthday, old man.

101
00:03:58,710 --> 00:04:01,163
我的人生已经错过了太多精彩
Well, I've forgotten a lot of things in my life.

102
00:04:01,183 --> 00:04:03,425
杰的一番话简直是醍醐灌顶
But what Jay said hit me hard.

103
00:04:03,456 --> 00:04:05,899
我错过了我的童年
I'd forgotten to have a childhood.

104
00:04:05,909 --> 00:04:07,137
老爹 你刚刚闯红灯了
Dad, that was a stop sign.

105
00:04:07,146 --> 00:04:08,595
回家的时候我停两次就行了
I'll stop twice on the way back.

106
00:04:08,614 --> 00:04:12,183
很好 我们终于有机会拿回
Oh, good, it'll give us a chance to pick up that hubcap

107
00:04:12,183 --> 00:04:13,913
你横穿教堂停车场时落下的轮圈了
you lost cutting through the temple parking lot.

108
00:04:13,923 --> 00:04:15,763
黄灯 黄灯
Yellow...yellow!

109
00:04:16,647 --> 00:04:17,574
好吧
Okay.

110
00:04:17,583 --> 00:04:18,648
看到没
Are you seeing this?

111
00:04:18,648 --> 00:04:21,041
一路绿灯 咱都不用开多快
We are making every light, and we don't even have to speed.

112
00:04:21,072 --> 00:04:22,440
还是我的路给力
The system works.

113
00:04:22,610 --> 00:04:23,556
老妈
Mom?

114
00:04:23,585 --> 00:04:25,043
我知道 我刚刚是有点超速了
I know, I went a little fast back there,

115
00:04:25,043 --> 00:04:27,165
不过说真的 四十跟三十五差不多
but, really, 40 is the same as 35.

116
00:04:27,175 --> 00:04:28,644
你老这么说[讽刺年龄]
You say that a lot.

117
00:04:30,131 --> 00:04:32,092
我觉得你们还不知道现在该担心什么
I don't think you two appreciate what's at stake here.

118
00:04:32,092 --> 00:04:34,092
-我们的命吗 -你们知道我爱你们妈妈
- Our lives? - You know I love your mother,

119
00:04:34,103 --> 00:04:35,953
但你们也知道她那副嘴脸
but I think you also know a certain look she gets

120
00:04:35,973 --> 00:04:38,034
那种"听我的 我永远是对的"的表情
That says, "Just listen to me, I'm always right".

121
00:04:38,054 --> 00:04:39,271
你是说她盛气凌人的表情吗
You mean her face?

122
00:04:39,271 --> 00:04:40,498
现在你懂我的意思了吧
N-now we're getting this.

123
00:04:41,141 --> 00:04:42,096
如果我们这次赢了
If we're right this one time,

124
00:04:42,096 --> 00:04:43,936
以后就不用再听她指使了
then we never have to be right again.

125
00:04:43,986 --> 00:04:46,651
当她说"那气球载不了人的 菲尔"
When she says, "That balloon can't carry a person, Phil",

126
00:04:46,651 --> 00:04:48,431
我就说"记得曼尼生日那次吗"
I say, "Manny's birthday".

127
00:04:48,451 --> 00:04:50,401
"穿上夹克 艾丽克斯 会下雨的"
"Take your jacket, Alex. I think it's gonna rain".

128
00:04:50,401 --> 00:04:51,477
"记得曼尼生日那次吗"
"Manny's birthday".

129
00:04:51,477 --> 00:04:52,966
别看我 看路
Don't look at me. Look at the road.

130
00:04:52,975 --> 00:04:53,961
"记得曼尼生日那次吗"
"Manny's birthday".

131
00:04:53,961 --> 00:04:55,098
不 老爸 看路 前面有卡车
No, dad! Look at the road! There's a truck!

132
00:04:55,127 --> 00:04:56,887
没长眼睛吗 混蛋
Sweet baby! Assholes!

133
00:04:56,887 --> 00:04:58,867
你老爸这次输惨了
We are so kicking your dad's butt!

134
00:04:58,887 --> 00:05:00,406
我们是最棒的
We are the best ones!

135
00:05:00,406 --> 00:05:02,648
你和爸爸为什么要分手呀
How come you and dad are breaking up?

136
00:05:02,678 --> 00:05:03,785
什么
What?

137
00:05:03,794 --> 00:05:05,725
如果只是一点意见不合的话
If it's just a little disagreement,

138
00:05:05,725 --> 00:05:07,756
你们就不能好好解决吗
can't you just work it out?

139
00:05:07,776 --> 00:05:09,103
亲爱的 你以为
Oh, sweetie, you thought

140
00:05:09,103 --> 00:05:10,782
我说我们要分开的时候是指
that when I said we were splitting up...

141
00:05:10,792 --> 00:05:12,964
不 不 我跟你爸好着呢 宝贝儿
No. No, your dad and I are fine, honey.

142
00:05:12,964 --> 00:05:14,301
我们只是要一人开一辆车
We just were gonna take separate cars

143
00:05:14,311 --> 00:05:16,363
看谁先到餐厅
to see who could get to the restaurant faster.

144
00:05:16,383 --> 00:05:17,912
那我就放心了
Oh, that's a relief.

145
00:05:17,941 --> 00:05:20,556
你刚才肯定难受死了
Ohh, you must have been feeling awful back there.

146
00:05:20,576 --> 00:05:22,385
我真抱歉
I am so sorry.

147
00:05:22,385 --> 00:05:24,738
没事的
It's okay.

148
00:05:32,330 --> 00:05:35,406
你刚才为什么说你要跟你爸走
Why did you say you'd go with your dad?

149
00:05:36,171 --> 00:05:38,041
太好了 这下老妈又要赢了
Great. Mom gets to be right again.

150
00:05:38,071 --> 00:05:40,132
这种态度可是会输掉的
Hey, bad attitudes lose races.

151
00:05:40,132 --> 00:05:44,456
不对 冲向路边然后爆胎才会输呢
No, swerving into a curb and popping your tire loses races.

152
00:05:44,787 --> 00:05:46,979
我们应该报警说妈妈的车是偷来的
We should call the cops and say mom's car was stolen.

153
00:05:46,989 --> 00:05:48,237
然后警察就会去抓她 我们就赢了
They arrest her, we win.

154
00:05:48,256 --> 00:05:49,724
不行 警察会追踪报警电话的
No, they trace those calls.

155
00:05:49,724 --> 00:05:52,680
但是精神可嘉 开始有团队思考意识了
But this is great. Thinking like a team!

156
00:05:52,701 --> 00:05:54,591
这对我们的家庭露营会有帮助的
Good practice for family camp.

157
00:05:55,848 --> 00:05:58,703
我们 我们今年还要去吗
We're, uh, we're doing that again?

158
00:06:00,081 --> 00:06:02,816
而且今年我有预感 白队会大获全胜
And this year I predict total white domination.

159
00:06:07,089 --> 00:06:08,719
受不了那鬼地方了
Can't go back there.

160
00:06:08,738 --> 00:06:12,589
我听说今年夏天要跳风土舞
I heard this summer there's gonna be a hoedown.

161
00:06:12,921 --> 00:06:13,886
我受不了了
I can't.

162
00:06:13,886 --> 00:06:15,776
海莉
Haley!

163
00:06:15,816 --> 00:06:18,099
我受不了了 受不了了
I can't! I can't.

164
00:06:21,256 --> 00:06:23,217
跟文具店的女售货员聊了八分钟
Eight minutes talking to the lady at the stationery store

165
00:06:23,217 --> 00:06:24,384
结果还是什么礼物都没买到
and still no present.

166
00:06:24,403 --> 00:06:26,545
我认为新朋友就像礼物一样
You know, I think a new friend is like a present.

167
00:06:26,545 --> 00:06:27,802
是啊是啊 我也读过那张卡片了
Yeah, I read that card, too.

168
00:06:27,802 --> 00:06:29,251
我们能不能买我们看好的下一个东西
Can we please just buy the next thing we see

169
00:06:29,270 --> 00:06:29,965
然后赶紧走啊
and get out of here?

170
00:06:30,325 --> 00:06:31,311
你为什么就不能享受一下这个过程呢
You know, why can't you enjoy this?

171
00:06:31,311 --> 00:06:33,694
今天下午天气那么好 莉莉托给保姆了
It's a beautiful afternoon, Lily's with a sitter.

172
00:06:33,694 --> 00:06:34,952
这是咱俩的二人世界
The day is ours!

173
00:06:34,971 --> 00:06:36,931
海伦
Helen!

174
00:06:36,952 --> 00:06:39,345
海伦
Helen!

175
00:06:39,365 --> 00:06:41,999
海伦
Helen!

176
00:06:42,019 --> 00:06:43,075
海伦
Helen!!

177
00:06:43,075 --> 00:06:46,534
看呀 又交了个朋友 走吧 忙着呢
Oh, look at that. Another friend. Off we go. Very busy.

178
00:06:46,544 --> 00:06:47,651
不要 站住
No. Stop.

179
00:06:47,680 --> 00:06:49,751
你太受你那些死板的计划束缚了
You are too tied to your rigid schedules.

180
00:06:49,761 --> 00:06:50,525
你错过了真正的生活
You're missing life.

181
00:06:50,525 --> 00:06:53,240
你只要花两秒钟就可以帮到这个人
It took all of two seconds to help this nice man.

182
00:06:53,250 --> 00:06:56,035
等 等等 我还没说完呢
W-w-wait. Wait. There's more.

183
00:06:56,076 --> 00:06:58,137
两秒钟而已 还要说什么
Two seconds. Yeah.

184
00:06:58,147 --> 00:07:01,827
告诉她我很抱歉 我一直爱着她
Tell her I'm so sorry, I've always loved her.

185
00:07:01,837 --> 00:07:03,778
他说他很抱歉
He says he's so sorry!

186
00:07:03,788 --> 00:07:06,452
他一直爱着你
And that he's always loved you!

187
00:07:06,452 --> 00:07:08,775
请上来跟我谈谈
Please come up and talk to me.

188
00:07:08,785 --> 00:07:10,937
请上来跟他谈谈
Please come up and talk to him!

189
00:07:10,947 --> 00:07:13,420
你走了 他的生活将暗淡无光
His life would be empty without you!

190
00:07:13,420 --> 00:07:15,803
对不起我自由发挥了一下 有感而发
I'm sorry I'm going off script. It just felt right.

191
00:07:15,813 --> 00:07:17,593
没事
Oh. Good. Oh.

192
00:07:18,548 --> 00:07:19,936
-太迟了 -不 这样好了
- T-too late. - No, you know what?

193
00:07:19,936 --> 00:07:21,142
把你的手机给他
Give him your cellphone.

194
00:07:21,142 --> 00:07:23,043
我去追海伦 然后把我的手机给她
I'll chase Helen down and give her my phone.

195
00:07:23,043 --> 00:07:24,140
这样他们就可以好好谈谈了
They can hash it out.

196
00:07:24,149 --> 00:07:25,446
你是 你是认真的吗
Are you -- are you serious?

197
00:07:25,456 --> 00:07:29,005
没错 珍珠都没这么真
Yes, I'm serious as a heart attack.

198
00:07:31,529 --> 00:07:33,489
你老是这样
You always do this.

199
00:07:33,489 --> 00:07:34,867
我们连自己办的派对都要迟到了
Now we're gonna be late to our own party.

200
00:07:34,867 --> 00:07:36,476
别叫了
Stop shouting.

201
00:07:36,476 --> 00:07:38,074
严格来讲 我没有在
Well, technically, I wasn't really --

202
00:07:38,084 --> 00:07:41,875
你好 喂 西摩·巴茨在吗[音同"多点屁屁"]
Uh, yes, hello. Is Seymour Butts there?

203
00:07:41,875 --> 00:07:44,278
我从来没打过恶作剧电话
I'd never made a prank call...

204
00:07:44,298 --> 00:07:45,485
没试过把好几种汽水兑到一起
never mixed different sodas together

205
00:07:45,485 --> 00:07:47,767
尝尝是什么味
to see what they'd taste like.

206
00:07:47,767 --> 00:07:49,074
所以我知道我必须
So I knew I had to make the most

207
00:07:49,074 --> 00:07:51,126
充分利用一下我所剩不多的童年了
of what little childhood I had left.

208
00:07:51,126 --> 00:07:53,991
不是拉茨 我要找巴茨[与"屁屁"同音]
Not "Lutts". I'm looking for Butts.

209
00:07:54,011 --> 00:07:57,349
是的 我要找巴茨[与"屁屁"同音]
Yes, I'm trying to get ahold of Butts.

210
00:07:57,359 --> 00:08:00,195
很好笑 我没时间跟你犯傻
Very funny. I don't have time for this foolishness.

211
00:08:01,371 --> 00:08:03,935
也许你放东西应该更有条理
Maybe if you had a system for where you leave things.

212
00:08:03,935 --> 00:08:05,162
我当然有条理
I have a system.

213
00:08:05,162 --> 00:08:08,470
我把东西放下 然后再记住我放哪了
I put down things, then I remember where I put them.

214
00:08:08,470 --> 00:08:09,767
比如说 你要是能把钥匙
And that would be preferable

215
00:08:09,767 --> 00:08:12,743
放在这个长得像把大钥匙的
to, say, putting them on the key holder

216
00:08:12,743 --> 00:08:15,569
钥匙架上就更好了
which just happens to look like a large key.

217
00:08:15,569 --> 00:08:17,811
别再叫唤了
Stop screaming!

218
00:08:21,803 --> 00:08:22,527
你在干吗
What are you doing?

219
00:08:22,527 --> 00:08:24,216
找回逝去的童年
Turning back the clock.

220
00:08:37,739 --> 00:08:38,956
真恶心
Disgusting!

221
00:08:38,956 --> 00:08:41,922
不许说我 你又没结过婚
Don't judge me. You've never been married.

222
00:08:41,932 --> 00:08:43,430
这件事从没发生过
This never happened.

223
00:08:43,440 --> 00:08:45,190
我不知道你在说什么
I don't know what you're talking about.

224
00:08:45,200 --> 00:08:46,598
好样的 老伙计
That's a good man.

225
00:08:46,598 --> 00:08:49,956
男孩 我是个男孩
Boy. I'm a boy!

226
00:08:54,450 --> 00:08:56,964
你还好吧 没事吧
You all right? You okay?

227
00:08:56,984 --> 00:08:59,619
还用问吗
W-why do you ask?

228
00:09:00,413 --> 00:09:03,480
好的 我想这是找你的
Oh. Okay. Well, I think this is for you.

229
00:09:03,480 --> 00:09:05,299
我 我不知道该跟他说什么
I-I don't know what to say to him.

230
00:09:05,299 --> 00:09:07,833
你就敞开心扉然后听他说就好了 海伦
Just open your heart and listen, Helen.

231
00:09:07,853 --> 00:09:09,282
好吧
Okay.

232
00:09:09,291 --> 00:09:10,438
喂
Hello?

233
00:09:13,947 --> 00:09:16,138
我把你的电话弄掉了
I dropped your phone.

234
00:09:16,159 --> 00:09:17,989
我就在这眼睁睁地看着呢
I was here when it happened.

235
00:09:17,999 --> 00:09:19,798
好了 没事的 我们就
Okay. It's all right. We'll just...

236
00:09:19,798 --> 00:09:21,538
我做不到 我做不到
I can't. I-I just can't.

237
00:09:21,538 --> 00:09:24,223
海伦 你要勇于尝试 我曾经
Helen, you have to try. I once almost let my own fears

238
00:09:24,253 --> 00:09:25,982
差点被恐惧占据而放弃了一段感情
stop me from embarking on a relationship,

239
00:09:26,002 --> 00:09:29,059
从而错过了我生命中的挚爱
and I would have lost the love of my life.

240
00:09:29,059 --> 00:09:31,221
-海伦 -唐纳德
- Helen! - Donald!

241
00:09:31,221 --> 00:09:34,267
-小卡 -坚持住 抓紧了 海伦
- Cam... - Hang on. Hang on, Helen!

242
00:09:34,267 --> 00:09:36,097
我马上抱你下去
I'll have you down in a jiffy!

243
00:09:36,117 --> 00:09:37,796
抓紧 别掐我
Hold on tight! Ow. Nails.

244
00:09:37,796 --> 00:09:39,948
-海伦 别掐 别掐 -海伦
- Helen. Nails. Nails. Nails. - Helen.

245
00:09:39,948 --> 00:09:44,071
海伦 求你再给我一次机会
Helen, please just give me a chance.

246
00:09:44,081 --> 00:09:45,539
给他一个机会吧
Give him a chance!!

247
00:09:45,539 --> 00:09:46,997
她现在就在这儿
She's right here.

248
00:09:46,997 --> 00:09:48,546
小卡快点 我们没时间了
Cam, come on. We're running out of time.

249
00:09:48,575 --> 00:09:50,717
谁说没时间了 瞎操心
We're running out of time? Sensitive.

250
00:09:50,727 --> 00:09:52,486
接受他吧
Go to him.

251
00:09:52,486 --> 00:09:55,262
真感谢你那么关心我们
Ohh, I-it's nice that you care so much about us.

252
00:09:55,262 --> 00:09:56,770
没有爱的话我们什么都不是
Without love we're nothing.

253
00:09:56,770 --> 00:09:58,901
但是他的老婆怎么办
But what about his wife?

254
00:10:00,550 --> 00:10:02,642
很高兴认识你俩
It was a pleasure to meeting you both.

255
00:10:06,221 --> 00:10:08,644
我知道了 卢克 你觉得他比较有趣
I get it, Luke. You think he's the fun one.

256
00:10:08,654 --> 00:10:10,474
所以你才跟他一起
That's why you'd go with him.

257
00:10:10,474 --> 00:10:11,782
什么
What?

258
00:10:11,782 --> 00:10:14,195
你觉得你老爸比我有意思
You think your dad is more fun than I am.

259
00:10:14,215 --> 00:10:16,306
-当然 -"当然"
- Definitely. - "Definitely."

260
00:10:16,326 --> 00:10:18,629
老爸超级有趣
Dad's, like, crazy-fun.

261
00:10:18,639 --> 00:10:20,552
-但是你很好人 -我就是个好人吗
- But you're nice. - I'm nice?!

262
00:10:20,552 --> 00:10:22,380
现在不是了
Well, not now.

263
00:10:23,556 --> 00:10:24,864
跟他说吧
Tell him.

264
00:10:24,883 --> 00:10:26,612
-跟我说什么 -没事
- Tell me what? - Nothing.

265
00:10:26,612 --> 00:10:29,900
姑娘们 我们管老爸的车叫什么
Hey, what do we call daddy's car, girls?

266
00:10:29,910 --> 00:10:30,825
信任之蛋卷筒
The cone of trust.

267
00:10:30,825 --> 00:10:32,836
信任之蛋卷筒 没错
The cone of trust. Exactamundo.

268
00:10:32,866 --> 00:10:34,827
在这儿你们可以畅所欲言而不受批评
Where you can speak your mind with no judgment.

269
00:10:34,827 --> 00:10:36,878
那么 是什么 关于男生吗
So, what is it? Boys?

270
00:10:36,878 --> 00:10:39,191
你们的身体变化吗 还是排卵
Your bodies are changing? Eggs?

271
00:10:39,201 --> 00:10:40,930
不 不
No! No.

272
00:10:40,960 --> 00:10:42,891
我们只是想也许
We were just thinking that maybe...

273
00:10:42,901 --> 00:10:45,606
如果你能接受的话
...if -- if you're open to it --

274
00:10:45,626 --> 00:10:47,868
爸 我们爱你 但是我们今年真的
Dad, we love you, but we do not want

275
00:10:47,888 --> 00:10:50,744
不想去家庭夏令营了
to go to family camp this year.

276
00:10:53,006 --> 00:10:57,018
-爸 你生气了吗 -没有
- Dad? Are you upset? - Nope.

277
00:10:57,028 --> 00:10:58,426
那这抽泣声是怎么回事
Then what was that sniff?

278
00:10:58,436 --> 00:11:00,909
抽泣 什么抽泣 我 我
Sniff? What sniff? I'm -- I'm, uh --

279
00:11:00,919 --> 00:11:02,076
我其实是如释重负
I'm actually relieved.

280
00:11:03,011 --> 00:11:04,348
我一直在担心有一天
The day that I've been dreading,

281
00:11:04,348 --> 00:11:06,510
你们最终长大了 不再需要我
uh, the day when you two finally outgrow me,

282
00:11:06,510 --> 00:11:07,314
这天终于到来了
has finally arrived,

283
00:11:07,314 --> 00:11:10,270
而我淡定得很
and I'm handling it really well.

284
00:11:10,682 --> 00:11:12,985
-老爸 你在哭吗 -没有
- Dad, are you crying? - Nope.

285
00:11:12,995 --> 00:11:15,328
-你确定你没事吗 -没事
- Are you sure you're okay? - Yep.

286
00:11:15,348 --> 00:11:16,645
我的天哪 他哭了
Oh, my god. He is crying.

287
00:11:16,655 --> 00:11:18,254
我以前从来没见咱爸哭过
I've never seen dad cry before.

288
00:11:18,264 --> 00:11:20,636
但是 老爸 要是你哭的话 我也要哭了
But, dad, if you cry, then I'll cry!

289
00:11:20,647 --> 00:11:22,125
我没哭
I'm not crying.

290
00:11:22,155 --> 00:11:24,890
我们把老爸弄哭了
We made our daddy cry!

291
00:11:24,910 --> 00:11:26,238
你叫我爸爸吗
You called me daddy?

292
00:11:26,247 --> 00:11:28,328
因为你就是我们老爸
Because you are our daddy!

293
00:11:28,359 --> 00:11:30,259
我永远是你们的爸爸
I'll always be your daddy!

294
00:11:32,511 --> 00:11:33,648
别哭啊妈
Don't cry, mom.

295
00:11:33,667 --> 00:11:36,634
我没哭
I am not crying.

296
00:11:36,654 --> 00:11:39,047
我告诉你一个秘密 卢克
Let me fill you in on a little secret, Luke.

297
00:11:39,067 --> 00:11:40,927
我刚跟你爸认识的时候 也很风趣
When I met your dad, I was fun, too.

298
00:11:40,947 --> 00:11:42,577
但是后来我不得不放弃
But I had to give all that up,

299
00:11:42,586 --> 00:11:44,567
因为你们不能有一对风趣的爸妈
because you can't have two fun parents.

300
00:11:44,587 --> 00:11:46,618
那样就不可收拾了
That's a carnival.

301
00:11:46,648 --> 00:11:50,187
你记得那个叫利亚姆的小孩吗 就是穿着睡衣上学
You know that kid Liam who wears pajama pants to school

302
00:11:50,208 --> 00:11:52,540
然后用一百美元买东西的那个
and pays for things with a $100 bill?

303
00:11:52,550 --> 00:11:56,834
他就有一对有趣的父母 记住我的话
Two fun parents. Mark my words.

304
00:11:58,090 --> 00:12:01,831
啊 我的天
Oh, my god! Ohh!

305
00:12:01,841 --> 00:12:03,379
老妈 你也很有趣
You're fun, too, mom.

306
00:12:03,389 --> 00:12:04,847
我刚才说我要跟老爸一起
I just said I'd go with dad

307
00:12:04,847 --> 00:12:08,105
是因为我觉得 他更需要我
because I think he'd need me more.

308
00:12:16,038 --> 00:12:18,944
怎么我在这到处找 而你却干坐着
How come I do all the looking and you do all the sitting?

309
00:12:18,954 --> 00:12:20,302
因为都是你弄丢的
'Cause you do all the losing.

310
00:12:20,311 --> 00:12:21,640
你再唠叨 我就让你每天
Oh, and you're this close

311
00:12:21,659 --> 00:12:24,343
都睡后院的帐篷
of doing all the sleeping in a tent in the backyard!

312
00:12:24,866 --> 00:12:25,873
你翻过你的包了吗
Did you check your purse?

313
00:12:25,902 --> 00:12:26,857
当然了
Yes, of course!

314
00:12:26,857 --> 00:12:28,858
这包很大 你最好再检查一遍
It's a big purse. You might want to look again.

315
00:12:28,868 --> 00:12:31,995
好吧 我检查 您老坐着
Okay. I check. You rest.

316
00:12:36,872 --> 00:12:38,923
不在里面
No. There's nothing.

317
00:12:38,933 --> 00:12:39,908
你确定
You're sure?

318
00:12:39,908 --> 00:12:42,140
是的 我都看了两遍了
Yes. I've looked twice now.

319
00:12:42,140 --> 00:12:43,065
-什么都没有 -好吧
- There's nothing. - Okay.

320
00:12:43,065 --> 00:12:45,750
那你最好帮我们叫辆出租车
Then you better call us a cab!

321
00:12:45,760 --> 00:12:49,772
曼尼 曼尼
Manny! Manny?

322
00:12:50,023 --> 00:12:52,316
怎么回事 这东西哪来的
What the hell? Where'd that thing come from?

323
00:12:52,316 --> 00:12:56,659
两年前的圣诞节 从来没从盒子里拿出来过
Christmas. Two years ago. Never took it out of the box.

324
00:12:56,659 --> 00:12:58,229
我当时想"谁会喜欢这个呢"
"Who would enjoy that?" I thought.

325
00:12:58,238 --> 00:13:00,380
答案就是 小朋友
A kid, that's who.

326
00:13:00,390 --> 00:13:01,918
快点 我们要去你的派对了
Well, come on. We've got your party.

327
00:13:01,918 --> 00:13:05,980
何必呢 你说的对 我生来就十六岁
What's the point? You were right. I-I was born 16.

328
00:13:05,990 --> 00:13:08,122
我没有童年
I've lost my childhood.

329
00:13:08,142 --> 00:13:11,460
你为什么让我再翻一遍包包 杰
Why did you want me to look again in my purse, Jay, huh?

330
00:13:11,480 --> 00:13:13,380
是不是你把钥匙放进去的
Is it because you put the keys in there?

331
00:13:13,380 --> 00:13:14,657
我没有 怎么 你找到钥匙了吗
No. Why, did you find it?

332
00:13:14,657 --> 00:13:16,980
没错 那是因为是你把钥匙放进去的
Yes, I found them because you put the keys in there!

333
00:13:17,000 --> 00:13:18,599
曼尼 你他奶奶的在那干什么呢
Manny, what the hell are you doing there?

334
00:13:18,599 --> 00:13:21,273
他想取消派对 因为他错过了童年
He wants to cancel his party because he missed his childhood

335
00:13:21,324 --> 00:13:23,526
这个派对我重新安排了三次
The party that I have rescheduled three times,

336
00:13:23,526 --> 00:13:25,034
换了两次餐厅
changed the restaurant twice

337
00:13:25,034 --> 00:13:27,156
就为了全家能聚在一起 你现在说不去了
so that the whole family could be together?!

338
00:13:27,156 --> 00:13:28,593
我表示抱歉
Please send my regrets.

339
00:13:28,603 --> 00:13:30,534
现在可以给我点私人空间了吧
Now, if I could have a little privacy...

340
00:13:30,554 --> 00:13:32,686
私人空间
Privacy?! Esto es lo que me faltaba a me.

341
00:13:32,686 --> 00:13:34,224
私人空间吗
Privacy?! En esta casa?

342
00:13:34,244 --> 00:13:35,733
下面那个是滑板吗
Is that a skateboard down there?

343
00:13:36,446 --> 00:13:39,010
这是我今天失去的第二件东西
The second thing that slipped right out from under me today.

344
00:13:39,040 --> 00:13:40,147
好了 快出来吧
Okay, time to get out.

345
00:13:40,166 --> 00:13:41,282
第一个是我的童年
The first was my childhood.

346
00:13:41,282 --> 00:13:42,358
我知道了
I get it!

347
00:13:42,358 --> 00:13:45,435
我真讨厌固执的人
I am so sick of stubborn men!

348
00:13:45,445 --> 00:13:47,366
你 你表现的就像个
You, you act like a little boy

349
00:13:47,366 --> 00:13:49,537
不承认自己犯了错的小屁孩
That doesn't want to accept that he's wrong.

350
00:13:49,558 --> 00:13:52,594
而你就像一个自怨自艾的老头子
And you like a sad old man that doesn't want to be happy!

351
00:13:52,624 --> 00:13:54,154
老娘受够了
That's it!

352
00:13:55,510 --> 00:13:57,571
-你会射中我的 -得了吧 曼尼
- You could have shot me! - Come on, Manny.

353
00:13:57,571 --> 00:13:59,803
要是我想 我可以用这个打掉你的扣子
I could've unbuttoned your shirt if I wanted to.

354
00:13:59,844 --> 00:14:02,035
要么速度滚上来 要么跟着这岛一起沉没
Now come here, or sink!

355
00:14:02,056 --> 00:14:05,313
我会在车上带着这把枪的
And I'm taking this with me in the car.

356
00:14:07,395 --> 00:14:08,250
我们走吧
Vamonos.

357
00:14:12,392 --> 00:14:13,608
我认得你这表情 米奇尔
I know that face, Mitchell.

358
00:14:13,608 --> 00:14:14,685
好吧 我们要赶路呢
Okay, a-and we're walking.

359
00:14:14,694 --> 00:14:16,324
你这表情是说你对了 而我错了
It means you were right and I was wrong

360
00:14:16,343 --> 00:14:17,550
就因为我要帮助那俩人
for trying to help two people.

361
00:14:17,550 --> 00:14:19,209
-帮那对偷情的人吗 -我没话讲
- Adulterers? - Fair enough.

362
00:14:19,229 --> 00:14:21,059
说实话 他们是我见过最老的偷情者了
A-actually, the most adult adulterers ever.

363
00:14:21,069 --> 00:14:22,598
但我的初衷是好的
But my impulse was still right.

364
00:14:22,618 --> 00:14:24,518
-天呐 又来了 - 生活就是
- Oh, god. Here we go. - Life is about being --

365
00:14:24,528 --> 00:14:27,373
怎么 我就是要说
Yes. You know what? Here we do go.

366
00:14:27,373 --> 00:14:29,073
生活就是要跟着感觉走
It's about being spontaneous.

367
00:14:29,073 --> 00:14:30,953
做自己想做的事情
It's about throwing yourself into something,

368
00:14:30,973 --> 00:14:33,989
而不是每晚都在公司工作加班
not working long hours every night at the office.

369
00:14:33,989 --> 00:14:35,890
你就像是生活在自己的...
It's like you're living your l--

370
00:14:37,428 --> 00:14:39,540
-神马情况 -不知道
- What is this? - I don't know.

371
00:14:39,892 --> 00:14:42,647
打扰一下 警官 这是神马情况
Excuse me, constable, what -- what is going on?

372
00:14:48,669 --> 00:14:51,203
我知道了 是快闪族 快闪族
Oh, it's a flash mob! It's a flash mob!

373
00:14:51,233 --> 00:14:53,295
还记得吗 我们一起在视频网上看过
Ooh! We saw it on Youtube. Remember?

374
00:14:53,315 --> 00:14:55,647
许多人们聚在一起跳舞
People get together and choreograph big dance numbers!

375
00:14:55,657 --> 00:14:57,407
我们还是快走吧 这有点怪异
We should go. T-this is kind of weird.

376
00:14:57,437 --> 00:14:59,378
不要 这很有趣 米奇尔
No, this is joyful, Mitchell.

377
00:14:59,378 --> 00:15:02,656
你应该...
You, of all people, should --

378
00:15:18,180 --> 00:15:20,845
小卡说的对 我是有点死板
Cam's right. I can be a little rigid.

379
00:15:20,845 --> 00:15:23,881
所以有一天当会计部的查德
So when Chad from accounting,

380
00:15:23,881 --> 00:15:26,304
一个我一直以为是男同
who I always thought was gay

381
00:15:26,304 --> 00:15:27,943
但其实却不是的人
but apparently is not,

382
00:15:27,973 --> 00:15:30,005
问我要不要参加这次的快闪族活动
Um, told me about this flash mob,

383
00:15:30,015 --> 00:15:32,388
我说 当然愿意
I thought, "Hells yes".

384
00:15:32,398 --> 00:15:34,760
我们每礼拜有好几天在下班后练舞
Uh, we've been practicing after work a couple of nights a week.

385
00:15:34,760 --> 00:15:36,339
我们付出了很多
And it's -- it's been a big commitment,

386
00:15:36,359 --> 00:15:38,662
但这太值了
but it's totally worth it.

387
00:15:38,672 --> 00:15:42,583
这次的舞蹈是我对小卡的一次爱的表白
This dance is my love letter to Cam.

388
00:16:11,501 --> 00:16:14,457
好了 这就是我一直催你的原因
Okay, so, this is why I was rushing you around.

389
00:16:14,467 --> 00:16:17,342
怎么样 有没有改变你对我的看法
Huh? What do you think of me now?

390
00:16:17,352 --> 00:16:18,480
你怎么能这样对我 米奇尔
How could you, Mitchell?

391
00:16:18,499 --> 00:16:20,489
怎么了 卡梅隆
What? Cameron.

392
00:16:20,510 --> 00:16:23,466
-卡梅隆 -别烦我 唐纳德
- Cameron. - Not now. Donald!

393
00:16:24,602 --> 00:16:26,201
你也有搞笑的时候
You do fun stuff.

394
00:16:26,211 --> 00:16:28,885
你曾放过一片薯片在我的三明治里
You put that potato chip in my sandwich.

395
00:16:28,895 --> 00:16:30,172
咔嚓一声 吓了我一跳
That was a crunchy surprise.

396
00:16:30,172 --> 00:16:34,254
那是你爸的主意 家里的笑料都是他的主意
Nope, that was your dad. Everything fun is your dad.

397
00:16:34,265 --> 00:16:36,607
圣再诞节 意大利口音之夜
Second Christmas, Italian-accent night...

398
00:16:36,607 --> 00:16:37,633
还有这次比赛
this race.

399
00:16:37,633 --> 00:16:41,494
我们能赢这次比赛的 你挑的路近多了
Which we could've won. Your way is way faster.

400
00:16:41,514 --> 00:16:43,927
那是当然啊
It is, isn't it?

401
00:16:44,078 --> 00:16:45,527
坐稳了 卢克
Buckle up, Luke.

402
00:16:45,536 --> 00:16:48,643
今天你将有一对搞笑的父母
Today you have two fun parents.

403
00:16:49,900 --> 00:16:51,358
老妈加油 我相信你
Come on, mom. You can do it.

404
00:16:51,378 --> 00:16:52,565
那是当然
That's right I can.

405
00:16:52,584 --> 00:16:53,872
说实话吧 杰
Tell me the truth, Jay.

406
00:16:53,891 --> 00:16:55,691
是不是你把钥匙放在我包里的
Did you put the key in my bag?

407
00:16:55,701 --> 00:16:56,899
不是
No.

408
00:16:56,908 --> 00:16:59,331
我不会生气
I won't be mad.

409
00:17:00,638 --> 00:17:02,800
为了证明我的观点 我有可能
In order to prove a point, I may have --

410
00:17:02,810 --> 00:17:05,485
我就知道
I knew it!

411
00:17:05,495 --> 00:17:07,526
我怎么会给你买这么大一块表
Why did I get you such a big watch?!

412
00:17:07,526 --> 00:17:09,577
为什么 杰 你到底想证明什么
Why, Jay?! What point did you have to prove?!

413
00:17:09,577 --> 00:17:11,427
我想让你变得有条理
I'm trying to teach you to be organized.

414
00:17:11,437 --> 00:17:12,915
你太散漫了 歌洛莉亚
Your mind is scattered, Gloria.

415
00:17:12,925 --> 00:17:14,775
看看待会谁比较散
Your mind is gonna be scattered.

416
00:17:14,795 --> 00:17:16,425
曼尼 把枪拿来
Manny, hand me the gun!

417
00:17:16,434 --> 00:17:17,642
谢谢你献舞给我
I appreciate the gesture,

418
00:17:17,681 --> 00:17:19,823
我也觉得我这个态度不太好
and I'm not proud of how I'm feeling right now,

419
00:17:19,853 --> 00:17:22,588
可问题是 你对我不忠
but the fact is, you cheated on me.

420
00:17:22,588 --> 00:17:23,735
我这算哪门子不忠
In what way did I cheat on you?

421
00:17:23,754 --> 00:17:25,705
你瞒着我排练舞蹈
You cheated on me with choreography,

422
00:17:25,705 --> 00:17:27,675
这是最严重的不忠
and that is the worst kind.

423
00:17:27,695 --> 00:17:29,606
这真的不算
Well, it really isn't.

424
00:17:29,616 --> 00:17:32,572
你居然不带我 自己去跳舞 米奇尔
You danced without me, Mitchell!

425
00:17:32,602 --> 00:17:34,010
早知道去年是我最后一次野营
If I'd known it was my last summer there,

426
00:17:34,010 --> 00:17:35,840
我就去竞争Pippin游戏社团的领导
I'd have gone for the lead in "Pippin."

427
00:17:38,343 --> 00:17:40,344
老爸 看前面 老妈正朝我们开过来
Dad, look up ahead. Coming at us. There's mom!

428
00:17:40,354 --> 00:17:41,581
打败他
Beat her!

429
00:17:41,581 --> 00:17:43,150
我认为他现在没心情比赛
I don't think he's in the mood for that right now.

430
00:17:43,150 --> 00:17:44,819
够了 不行
Hold on. No.

431
00:17:44,849 --> 00:17:48,559
现在最需要赢得胜利的人 就是你
If ever a man needed a win, it's this man.

432
00:17:48,579 --> 00:17:49,737
你觉得呢 老爸
What do you say, dad?

433
00:17:49,746 --> 00:17:52,873
好的 为了家庭野营
Okay. This one's for family camp.

434
00:17:54,833 --> 00:17:57,618
冲 冲 冲 冲 冲 冲 冲 冲
Go! Go! Go! Go! Go! Go! Go! Go!

435
00:17:57,639 --> 00:17:59,670
-这感觉太刺激了 -我爱你
- This is so inappropriate! - I love you!

436
00:18:01,459 --> 00:18:04,365
冲 冲 冲 冲 冲 冲 冲 冲
Go! Go! Go! Go! Go! Go! Go! Go!

437
00:18:06,195 --> 00:18:07,764
妈妈 小心
Mom, look out!

438
00:18:07,764 --> 00:18:09,061
小心 小卡
Cam!

439
00:18:13,937 --> 00:18:15,797
有人受伤吗
Anybody hurt?

440
00:18:15,797 --> 00:18:18,824
我
I am.

441
00:18:22,584 --> 00:18:24,877
我今天本来郁闷得都不想来了
I was almost too depressed to come today.

442
00:18:24,897 --> 00:18:28,567
我发现我虚度了我的童年
I realized I let my childhood slip away.

443
00:18:28,587 --> 00:18:29,945
看看卢克
Look at Luke there...

444
00:18:29,975 --> 00:18:32,046
用三个吸管连成一根长的
making one big straw out of three.

445
00:18:32,056 --> 00:18:33,585
保持童心吧 卢克
Never change, Luke.

446
00:18:34,741 --> 00:18:37,204
我真的以为现在挽回童年已经太迟了
I really thought it was too late for me.

447
00:18:37,224 --> 00:18:39,024
但看到你们都这么大了还一个个耍孩子气
But watching all you acting like children,

448
00:18:39,034 --> 00:18:42,493
我恍然大悟 我还有大把时间当小孩呢
it hit me -- I've got plenty of time left to be a kid.

449
00:18:42,493 --> 00:18:45,630
总而言之 祝我生日快乐
Anyway, happy birthday to me.

450
00:18:46,535 --> 00:18:47,892
生日快乐 曼尼
Happy birthday, Manny.

451
00:18:47,922 --> 00:18:50,074
生日快乐 曼尼
Happy birthday, Manny.

452
00:18:50,104 --> 00:18:52,538
我太小孩子气了
I have been a child.

453
00:18:52,538 --> 00:18:54,188
抱歉我藏了你的钥匙
I'm sorry I hid the keys.

454
00:18:54,197 --> 00:18:57,605
很抱歉我射沉了那座小岛
I'm sorry I shoot the island.

455
00:18:57,625 --> 00:18:58,883
我们回家的路上再比一次
We're totally racing home.

456
00:18:58,892 --> 00:19:00,562
我可比你快多了
I'm way ahead of you.

457
00:19:00,571 --> 00:19:03,497
一向如此
As usual.

458
00:19:08,183 --> 00:19:10,053
天气预报说本周末会下雨
They say it's going to be a rainy weekend.

459
00:19:10,063 --> 00:19:11,330
天气预报啥时候准过
They don't know.

460
00:19:11,330 --> 00:19:14,276
可是我准 我的膝盖都响了一个早上了
I do. My knee's been singing all morning.

461
00:19:16,005 --> 00:19:18,217
难以置信
Unbelievable.

462
00:19:28,694 --> 00:19:30,273
我的妈呀
Mother of g --

463
00:19:30,273 --> 00:19:32,194
把钥匙放下 然后走开
Put them down and walk away.

464
00:19:32,214 --> 00:19:34,305
我跟你说 歌洛莉亚
You know, Gloria --
